"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "I want to delve deeper.",
"char_start": 5082,
"char_end": 5105,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 324.304,
"end": 328.745,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "What is the opposing viewpoint that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 5106,
"char_end": 5178,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s02"
},
{
"start": 328.745,
"end": 333.993,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "It boils down to this: drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
"char_start": 5191,
"char_end": 5287,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 333.993,
"end": 337.055,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "We've seen it happen with teams using RockShox products.",
"char_start": 5288,
"char_end": 5344,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
"start": 337.055,
"end": 341.811,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "If you ignore it, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 5345,
"char_end": 5432,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s03"
},
{
"start": 341.811,
"end": 344.617,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "What is the typical process for dealing with a malfunction?",
"char_start": 5445,
"char_end": 5504,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s01"
},
{
"start": 344.617,
"end": 347.614,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "What is the most often overlooked aspect of trail construction?",
"char_start": 5505,
"char_end": 5568,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s02"
},
{
"start": 347.614,
"end": 353.338,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "Honestly, the most common mistake that novice builders make is digging with a slope that is too steep.",
"char_start": 5581,
"char_end": 5683,
"unit_id": "t0041.u01",
"sent_id": "t0041.s01"
},
{
"start": 353.338,
"end": 358.165,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "The overall picture is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 5684,
"char_end": 5770,
"unit_id": "t0041.u01",
"sent_id": "t0041.s02"
},
{
"start": 358.165,
"end": 363.292,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing listeners can try out this week?",
